  '英语', '二年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "What can we see in the sky at night?", "options": ["A. Stars", "B. Flowers", "C. Books", "D. Apples"]}', 'A', '星星（stars）在夜晚的天空中闪闪发光，所以正确答案是A。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '二年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "The ______ shine in the sky at night.", "options": null}', 'stars', '句子意思是“夜晚，______在天空中闪烁。”根据单元主题“Stars in the sky”，这里应该填“stars”（星星）。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '二年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "How many stars are there in the sky?", "options": ["A. There is one star.", "B. There are many stars.", "C. There are no stars."]}', 'B', '天空中有很多星星，所以要用 ''There are many stars.'' 来回答。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
