  '英语', '二年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "What is a big task?", "options": ["A. Drawing one star", "B. Drawing a picture of the whole sky with many stars", "C. Writing your name", "D. Reading one word"]}', 'B', 'A big task is a larger job with many steps, like drawing a whole sky full of stars. Small tasks are easier, like drawing just one star.', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '二年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "Complete the sentence: Making a model of the solar system is a ______ task, because it has many parts to do.", "options": null}', 'big', 'A big task has many steps or parts. Making a model of the solar system needs a lot of work, so it is a big task.', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '二年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "Which word means ''a big animal that lives in the sea and has a long tail''?", "options": ["A. fish", "B. whale", "C. shark", "D. starfish"]}', 'B', '鲸鱼是一种生活在海里、有大尾巴的动物。选项A鱼是泛指，C鲨鱼有鳍，D海星是星形的，所以选B.', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '二年级', '填空', 2, '{"stem": "Look at the picture: a small animal with eight legs in the sea. It is an ______.", "options": null}', 'octopus', '章鱼（octopus）有八条腿，是海里的小动物。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '二年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "What can you see in the sea?", "options": ["A. I can see a fish.", "B. I can see a book.", "C. I can see a cat.", "D. I can see a tree."]}', 'A', '题目问的是在海里能看到什么，鱼生活在海里，所以选A。书、猫和树都不在海里。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '二年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "Look at the sea! I can see a ______ (乌龟).", "options": null}', 'turtle', '乌龟的英文是turtle，它是生活在海里的动物，所以填turtle。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '二年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "Listen to the rhyme: \"In the sea, in the sea, a little fish swims to me.\" What animal is in the rhyme?", "options": ["A. A little fish", "B. A big shark", "C. A red crab", "D. A green turtle"]}', 'A', '儿歌里说‘a little fish swims to me’，所以是a little fish。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '二年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "Complete the song: \"In the sea, in the sea, a little ______ swims to me.\"", "options": null}', 'fish', '这首歌唱的是海里的小鱼，所以填fish。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '二年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "Which one is a big task?", "options": ["A. Draw a fish", "B. Build a big ship", "C. Color a star", "D. Write one word"]}', 'B', 'Build a big ship is a big task because it is hard and takes a long time. The other tasks are small and easy.', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '二年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "In the sea, a whale is a ___ animal, but a shrimp is a small animal.", "options": null}', 'big', 'A whale is very big, so we use the word ''big'' to describe it. This helps us understand big and small tasks in the sea.', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '二年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "Which word means ''太阳'' in English?", "options": ["A. sun", "B. moon", "C. star", "D. cloud"]}', 'A', '太阳在英语中是''sun''，所以选A。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '二年级', '填空', 2, '{"stem": "Look at the _______. It is very big and bright in the sky during the day.", "options": null}', 'sun', '白天天空中又大又亮的是太阳，所以填''sun''。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '二年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "Look at the sun! It is ______.", "options": ["A. big", "B. happy", "C. blue", "D. small"]}', 'A', '太阳很大，所以用 big。其他选项 happy（开心）、blue（蓝色）、small（小）不符合描述。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '二年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "The tree is ______ (tall / short). I can see it from my window.", "options": null}', 'tall', '从窗户能看到树，说明树很高，所以填 tall。short 是矮的意思，不符合。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '二年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "Which song is about the sun?", "options": ["Twinkle, Twinkle, Little Star", "Row, Row, Row Your Boat", "Mr. Sun", "Old MacDonald Had a Farm"]}', 'C', 'Mr. Sun 是一首关于太阳的儿歌，其他选项分别关于星星、小船和农场动物。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '二年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "在儿歌《Rain, Rain, Go Away》中，我们唱到：“Rain, rain, go away, come again another ______.”", "options": null}', 'day', '这首儿歌的歌词是‘Rain, rain, go away, come again another day’，意思是‘雨，雨，快走开，改天再来’。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '二年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "What is a big task?", "options": ["A. Drawing a picture", "B. Cleaning your room", "C. Making a model", "D. Reading a book"]}', 'C', 'A big task is a larger project, like making a model. Cleaning your room is a small task.', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '二年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "A small task is easy to finish. For example, ______ your shoes is a small task.", "options": null}', 'tying', 'Tying your shoes is a quick and easy job, so it is a small task.', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '二年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "I like to play with my ______.", "options": ["A. friend", "B. book", "C. apple"]}', 'A', '这句话是说‘我喜欢和我的……玩’。和朋友玩是常见的，所以选friend。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '二年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "I am a ______. I am seven years old.", "options": null}', 'boy/girl', '这句话是说‘我是一个……。我七岁了。’这里可以填boy（男孩）或girl（女孩），都正确。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '二年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "I ______ a boy.", "options": ["am", "is", "are"]}', 'am', '这句话说‘我是一个男孩’，主语是I，所以要用am。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '二年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "She ______ a girl. (填is或are)", "options": null}', 'is', '这句话说‘她是一个女孩’，主语She是单数，所以要用is。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '二年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "下面哪一首歌是关于介绍自己的？", "options": ["A. Twinkle, Twinkle, Little Star", "B. Hello, Hello, What''s Your Name?", "C. Happy Birthday to You", "D. Row, Row, Row Your Boat"]}', 'B', '《Hello, Hello, What''s Your Name?》是一首关于介绍自己名字的儿歌，符合“介绍自己”的主题。其他选项是关于星星、生日和划船的歌曲。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '二年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "请根据儿歌《Hello, Hello, What''s Your Name?》的歌词填空：Hello, hello, what''s your name? My name is ______.", "options": null}', 'Tom (或任何合理的名字，如 Lily、Sam 等)', '这首歌中，当别人问“你叫什么名字？”时，我们回答“我的名字是...”，可以填自己的名字或一个常见的英文名字。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '二年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "What is a big task?", "options": ["A. Eating a snack", "B. Drawing a picture", "C. Cleaning your room by yourself", "D. Playing a game"]}', 'C', 'A big task is something that takes more time and effort, like cleaning your room. Eating a snack or playing a game are small tasks.', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '二年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "I have a big task: I need to ________ (draw / read) a book report for school.", "options": null}', 'write', 'A book report is a big task because it takes time to write about a book. ''Draw'' is not right for a book report, we write it.', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "Which word means ''a room where you can read books'' in a school?", "options": ["A. classroom", "B. library", "C. playground", "D. toilet"]}', 'B', '图书馆（library）是学校里可以读书的地方。教室（classroom）是上课的地方，操场（playground）是玩耍的地方，厕所（toilet）是上厕所的地方，所以选B。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "In a school, we have a big room for eating lunch. It is called the c______.", "options": null}', 'cafeteria', '学校吃午饭的地方叫食堂（cafeteria）。这个单词以c开头，后面是a-f-e-t-e-r-i-a，所以填cafeteria。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "当你想问别人“这是你的学校吗？”时，应该怎么说？", "options": ["A. This is your school.", "B. Is this your school?", "C. This is my school.", "D. Is that your school?"]}', 'B', '问别人“这是你的学校吗？”要用一般疑问句，把is放在句子前面，所以选B。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "根据中文意思，补全句子：______ (这是) my classroom.", "options": null}', 'This is', '“这是”在英语中是This is，用来介绍近处的东西。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "What song do we sing in the school?", "options": ["A. The ABC Song", "B. Happy Birthday", "C. Our School Song"]}', 'C', '在学校里，我们唱的是校歌（Our School Song），不是字母歌或生日歌。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "Fill in the blank: In the song ''My School'', we sing: ''My school is so ______, I love it every day.''", "options": null}', 'nice', '这首歌里用''nice''来形容学校，意思是''好的、美好的''，表达对学校的喜爱。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "在英语课上，老师让你们完成一个“big task”，下面哪个活动最可能是big task？", "options": ["A. 写一个单词", "B. 画一张学校地图并介绍", "C. 读一个句子", "D. 抄写字母"]}', 'B', 'big task是指比较大的任务，需要花更多时间和精力。画学校地图并介绍需要做很多事，比写单词或读句子更难，所以是big task。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '填空', 1, '{"stem": "在英语课上，老师让你和同桌一起做一个____（big/small）task，比如互相问“Where is the library?”并回答。", "options": null}', 'small', '互相问路和回答是一个简单的任务，花时间少，所以是small task。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "What is the meaning of ''classmate''?", "options": ["A. 老师", "B. 同学", "C. 朋友", "D. 家人"]}', 'B', '''classmate'' 的意思是‘同学’，指的是和你一起上课的人。选项A是老师，C是朋友，D是家人，都不对。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '填空', 2, '{"stem": "My ________ is very kind. She helps me with my homework.（填一个表示‘同学’的英文单词）", "options": null}', 'classmate', '题目中‘同学’的英文是''classmate''，所以这里填''classmate''。注意单词拼写要正确哦。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "What ___ your name?", "options": ["A. is", "B. are", "C. am", "D. be"]}', 'A', '问名字时，主语是 your name（单数），所以用 is。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "— Is she your friend? — No, she ___ (is not / are not).", "options": null}', 'is not', '主语是 she（单数），所以用 is not，表示“她不是”。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "What song do we sing to say goodbye to our classmates?", "options": ["A. Happy Birthday", "B. Goodbye Song", "C. ABC Song", "D. Twinkle Twinkle Little Star"]}', 'B', 'Goodbye Song是专门用来告别的歌曲，其他选项分别是生日歌、字母歌和小星星，不符合题意。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "Fill in the blank: In the rhyme ''One, two, three, four, five, once I caught a fish _____.''", "options": null}', 'alive', '这首儿歌的完整歌词是''One, two, three, four, five, once I caught a fish alive.''，所以空白处应填''alive''。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "Which animal can swim in the water and has a long tail?", "options": ["A. cat", "B. fish", "C. dog", "D. bird"]}', 'B', '鱼（fish）能在水里游泳，还有长长的尾巴。猫和狗虽然也有尾巴，但它们不主要生活在水里；鸟有翅膀，不是游泳的动物。所以答案是B。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '填空', 1, '{"stem": "A _______ is a big animal that lives on a farm and gives us milk.", "options": null}', 'cow', '奶牛（cow）是农场里的大动物，它能给我们牛奶。所以横线上填cow。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "你想知道远处那只动物是什么，应该怎么问？", "options": ["A. What is this?", "B. What is that?", "C. Is this a dog?"]}', 'B', '问远处的动物要用 ''What is that?''，''this'' 指近处的东西。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "根据句意填空：—What is that? —______ a cat.", "options": null}', 'It is', '回答 ''What is that?'' 时，要用 ''It is'' 加上动物名称，表示''它是一只猫''。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "What animal says \"Moo\" in the song \"Old MacDonald Had a Farm\"?", "options": ["A. Cow", "B. Duck", "C. Pig", "D. Cat"]}', 'A', '在儿歌《Old MacDonald Had a Farm》中，发出"Moo"声音的动物是牛（cow），所以选A。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "In the rhyme \"Little Bo Peep\", she lost her _______. (请填写动物名称)", "options": null}', 'sheep', '儿歌《Little Bo Peep》中，小女孩Bo Peep丢失了她的羊（sheep），所以答案是sheep。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "What is the big task in Unit 3: Animals?", "options": ["A. Draw a picture of a cat", "B. Make a poster about your favorite animal", "C. Sing a song about animals", "D. Write a story about a dog"]}', 'B', '在Unit 3: Animals中，大任务（big task）是制作一张关于你最喜欢的动物的海报。小任务（small task）可能是画图或唱歌，但大任务是更重要的项目。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "In Unit 3: Animals, the small task is to ______ a picture of your favorite animal.", "options": null}', 'draw', '小任务（small task）通常是简单的活动，比如画一张你最喜欢的动物的图片。所以这里填draw（画）。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "Which word means ''生日'' in English?", "options": ["A. party", "B. birthday", "C. cake", "D. gift"]}', 'B', 'birthday 是生日的英文，其他选项：party 是聚会，cake 是蛋糕，gift 是礼物。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "We have a birthday p____ every year. (提示：聚会)", "options": null}', 'party', '句子意思是‘我们每年都有一个生日聚会’，party 是聚会的英文单词。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "— When is your birthday? — It''s ______ July 15th.", "options": ["A. in", "B. on", "C. at", "D. for"]}', 'B', '问生日具体是哪一天，用介词 ''on'' 加上日期。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "My birthday is ______ October. (填介词)", "options": null}', 'in', '月份前面用介词 ''in''，比如 ''in October''。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "What song do we sing on our birthday?", "options": ["A. Happy Birthday", "B. Twinkle Twinkle Little Star", "C. Old MacDonald", "D. London Bridge"]}', 'A', 'Happy Birthday 是我们生日时唱的生日歌，所以选 A。其他选项不是生日歌曲。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "在儿歌 ''Happy Birthday to you'' 中，我们唱到：Happy birthday to ___.", "options": null}', 'you', '歌词是 ''Happy birthday to you''，所以空格填 ''you''。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "在班级生日派对上，老师让大家分组完成一个任务。哪个是“小任务”（small task）？", "options": ["A. 制作整个生日蛋糕", "B. 吹一个气球", "C. 组织全班的游戏活动", "D. 设计派对邀请函"]}', 'B', '吹一个气球只需要一个人和简单动作，是容易完成的小任务。其他选项需要更多人参与或更复杂，属于大任务。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "在生日派对上，大家一起完成一个“big task”（大任务）。这个任务需要很多人合作，比如：______（请用英文写一个例子）。", "options": null}', 'make a big cake / decorate the room / organize games', '大任务需要团队合作，比如一起做蛋糕、装饰房间或组织游戏。这些都需要多人分工才能完成。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "你想告诉朋友你家附近有一个公园，应该怎么说？", "options": ["A. There is a park near my home.", "B. There is a school near my home.", "C. There is a shop near my home.", "D. There is a hospital near my home."]}', 'A', '题目问的是‘公园’，所以选A。其他选项分别是学校、商店和医院，不符合题意。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "根据句子意思，填入合适的单词：My neighbourhood has a big _______. I can buy food and drinks there.", "options": null}', 'shop', '句子说‘可以买食物和饮料’，所以这个地方是商店（shop）。其他常见词如park（公园）或library（图书馆）不能买东西。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "当你问别人“你的邻居里有什么？”时，应该怎么说？", "options": ["A. What''s in your neighbourhood?", "B. Where is your neighbourhood?", "C. How is your neighbourhood?", "D. Who is in your neighbourhood?"]}', 'A', '这道题问的是“你的邻居里有什么”，所以要用“What''s in your neighbourhood?”。其他选项问的是位置、情况或人，都不对哦。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "根据句意填空：There _______ a park near my home. (用“is”或“are”填空)", "options": null}', 'is', '因为“a park”是单数名词，所以用“is”。句子意思是“我家附近有一个公园”，单数就用is。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "Which song is about helping people in the neighbourhood?", "options": ["A. Twinkle, Twinkle, Little Star", "B. We Are the Helpers", "C. Old MacDonald Had a Farm", "D. The Wheels on the Bus"]}', 'B', '这首歌的歌词讲的是帮助邻居，比如送东西或说谢谢，其他选项都不是关于帮助邻居的。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "在儿歌《My Neighbourhood》中，有一句歌词是“I see the ______, it''s tall and bright.” 请根据歌词意思填空。", "options": null}', 'building', '这首歌描述社区里的东西，比如房子、商店，这里说又高又亮，所以是building（大楼）。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "What is a big task in your neighbourhood?", "options": ["A. Cleaning your room", "B. Helping to clean a park", "C. Reading a book", "D. Drawing a picture"]}', 'B', '打扫公园需要很多人和很多时间，所以是一个大任务（big task）。其他选项都是小任务（small task），一个人就能完成。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "In our neighbourhood, planting trees is a (big / small) task because it needs many people and takes a long time.", "options": null}', 'big', '种树需要很多人一起工作，而且时间很长，所以这是一个大任务（big task）。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "Which word means ''a season when leaves fall from trees''?", "options": ["A. Spring", "B. Summer", "C. Autumn", "D. Winter"]}', 'C', 'Autumn is the season when leaves fall from trees. Spring is for flowers, summer is hot, and winter is cold.', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "In autumn, we can see many ______ on the ground. (树叶)", "options": null}', 'leaves', '''Leaves'' is the plural of ''leaf''. In autumn, leaves fall from trees and cover the ground.', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "Which sentence is correct to ask about the weather in autumn?", "options": ["A. What is the weather like in autumn?", "B. What do you like in autumn?", "C. How is the weather in autumn?"]}', 'A', '问秋天的天气怎么样，正确的句型是 ''What is the weather like in autumn?''，选项B是问喜欢什么，选项C虽然意思对，但四年级学的是 ''What is...like'' 句型。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "根据提示完成句子：In autumn, the leaves ______ (fall / are falling) from the trees.", "options": null}', 'fall', '这里描述秋天的通常情况，用一般现在时，主语是复数leaves，所以用动词原形fall。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "Which song is about the season of autumn?", "options": ["A. Twinkle, Twinkle, Little Star", "B. The Leaves on the Trees", "C. Happy Birthday", "D. Old MacDonald Had a Farm"]}', 'B', '《The Leaves on the Trees》是一首关于秋天的儿歌，歌词中描述了树叶变色和落下，很适合秋天学习。其他选项是星星、生日和农场，与秋天无关。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "Fill in the blank: In the song ''Autumn Leaves'', the leaves are falling down, ____ down, down.", "options": null}', 'falling', '歌词里重复了''falling down''来强调树叶飘落的样子。所以空白处应该填''falling''，表示正在落下。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "What is a big task in autumn?", "options": ["A. Picking apples", "B. Drawing a picture", "C. Reading a book", "D. Playing games"]}', 'A', '在秋天，摘苹果是一个大任务，因为它需要很多时间和力气。画画、读书和玩游戏都是小任务。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "In autumn, we have a big task: ________ the leaves in the yard.", "options": null}', 'raking', '秋天院子里有很多落叶，耙树叶（raking the leaves）是一个大任务，需要大家一起帮忙。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "Which word means ''a meal you eat in the morning''?", "options": ["A. lunch", "B. breakfast", "C. dinner", "D. snack"]}', 'B', '早餐是breakfast，早上吃的饭。lunch是午餐，dinner是晚餐，snack是零食。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "I drink a glass of ______ every morning. (提示：一种白色的健康饮品，来自奶牛)", "options": null}', 'milk', '牛奶是milk，早上喝一杯牛奶很健康。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "What _____ you have for breakfast?", "options": ["A. do", "B. does", "C. is", "D. are"]}', 'A', '这句话问的是‘你早餐吃了什么？’，主语是‘you’，所以要用助动词‘do’。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '填空', 2, '{"stem": "I have _____ (一些牛奶) for breakfast.", "options": null}', 'some milk', '‘一些牛奶’在英语中是‘some milk’，‘milk’是不可数名词，所以前面用‘some’。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "What is the song ''A healthy breakfast'' mainly about?", "options": ["A. Eating junk food", "B. Eating a healthy breakfast", "C. Playing games", "D. Going to school"]}', 'B', '这首歌的题目是''A healthy breakfast''，所以它主要讲的是吃健康的早餐。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "In the song ''A healthy breakfast'', we sing: ''I eat some ______, I drink some milk.'' (提示：一种健康的食物，比如水果或面包)", "options": null}', 'fruit (或 bread, eggs 等健康食物，如答案合理可接受)', '歌词里提到健康的早餐，常见的有水果、面包或鸡蛋，所以填''fruit''很合适。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "What is a small task for making a healthy breakfast?", "options": ["A. Cooking a big meal for the whole family", "B. Washing an apple", "C. Baking a cake from scratch", "D. Planning a week of breakfasts"]}', 'B', '洗苹果是一个小任务，因为它简单、快速，适合小朋友完成。其他选项如做大餐、烤蛋糕或计划一周早餐都是大任务，需要更多时间和帮助。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "In the project ''A healthy breakfast'', a big task is to ______ (make/choose) a menu for the whole week.", "options": null}', 'make', '制作一周的菜单是一个大任务，因为它需要计划、选择和准备多种食物，而‘choose’（选择）通常指小任务，比如选一个水果。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "选出与诚实相关的单词：", "options": ["A. lie", "B. honest", "C. cheat", "D. steal"]}', 'B', 'honest 意思是‘诚实的’，其他选项 lie（说谎）、cheat（欺骗）、steal（偷窃）都是不诚实的行为。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "根据句子意思填空：Tom always tells the truth. He is an ________ boy.", "options": null}', 'honest', '句子说‘Tom总是说实话’，所以他是诚实的男孩，用单词 honest 填空。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "当你看到同学捡到别人的东西，你想告诉他要诚实，可以说：", "options": ["A. You should be honest.", "B. You are funny.", "C. I like you."]}', 'A', '选项A是“你应该诚实”，符合诚实主题；B是“你很有趣”，C是“我喜欢你”，都不对。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "根据句子意思填空：It''s not right to tell a lie. You should be ______.", "options": null}', 'honest', '句子意思是“说谎是不对的，你应该诚实”，所以填honest，表示诚实的。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "在歌曲《Honesty》中，歌词唱到“Honesty is the best ______”。空格里应该填哪个单词？", "options": ["A. rule", "B. policy", "C. way", "D. game"]}', 'B', '这首歌的歌词是“Honesty is the best policy”，意思是‘诚实是最好的策略’。所以选B。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "根据儿歌《The Honest Boy》的内容，填空：The boy found a wallet and gave it back to the ______. (提示：指钱包的主人)", "options": null}', 'owner', '儿歌里说小男孩捡到钱包后还给了失主，失主就是钱包的主人，英语是owner。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "What is a big task?", "options": ["A. Cleaning your room", "B. Doing homework for a week", "C. Brushing your teeth", "D. Eating breakfast"]}', 'B', 'A big task is something that takes more time and effort, like doing homework for a whole week. Cleaning your room, brushing your teeth, and eating breakfast are small tasks because they are quick and easy.', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "A small task is something you can finish in a short time. For example, ______ your shoes is a small task.", "options": null}', 'tying', 'Tying your shoes is a small task because it only takes a few seconds. Other small tasks include washing your hands or putting away a toy.', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "What time do you get up? I get up at ______.", "options": ["A. seven o''clock", "B. seven clock", "C. seven clocks", "D. o''clock seven"]}', 'A', '表示几点钟时，用''数字 + o''clock''，比如 seven o''clock（七点整）。其他选项顺序或形式不对。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "It''s time ______ go to school. (填一个介词)", "options": null}', 'to', '句型''It''s time to + 动词''表示''该做某事了''。这里 go to school 是动词短语，所以用 to。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "What time is it? It''s ______.", "options": ["A. seven o''clock", "B. seven clock", "C. seven oclok", "D. seven oclocks"]}', 'A', '表示整点时间，用 ''数字 + o''clock''，注意 o''clock 的拼写，中间有撇号，clock 是 ''钟'' 的意思，但这里要写 o''clock。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "It''s time ______ lunch. (填介词)", "options": null}', 'for', '句型 ''It''s time for + 名词'' 表示 ''该做某事了''，这里 lunch 是名词，所以用 for。如果是动词，则用 ''It''s time to + 动词''。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "What time does the song \"Tick Tock\" usually talk about?", "options": ["A. Eating time", "B. Time to go to school", "C. Time to sleep", "D. Time to play"]}', 'C', '这首儿歌《Tick Tock》通常讲的是睡觉时间，因为歌词里说‘Tick tock, it’s time to sleep’（滴答滴答，该睡觉了）。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "在儿歌《Hickory Dickory Dock》中，老鼠跑上了______。", "options": null}', '钟', '这首儿歌的歌词是‘Hickory dickory dock, the mouse ran up the clock’，所以老鼠跑上了钟。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "What is a big task?", "options": ["A. Doing homework for 10 minutes", "B. Writing a book report in a week", "C. Brushing teeth", "D. Eating breakfast"]}', 'B', 'A big task is a larger job that takes more time and effort, like writing a book report. Small tasks are quick and easy, like brushing teeth.', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "Complete the sentence: \"Finishing a puzzle with 100 pieces is a ______ task, but putting on your shoes is a ______ task.\"", "options": null}', 'big, small', 'A big task takes more time and effort, like finishing a big puzzle. A small task is quick and easy, like putting on shoes.', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "What is the weather like? It is ______ today. (今天天气怎么样？今天是______。)", "options": ["A. sunny", "B. apple", "C. book", "D. cat"]}', 'A', '问天气时，要用表示天气的词，如sunny（晴朗的）。其他选项apple（苹果）、book（书）、cat（猫）都不是天气词。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "Look at the picture. It is raining. The weather is ______. (看图片，正在下雨。天气是______。)", "options": null}', 'rainy', '下雨的天气用rainy（多雨的）。注意rainy是形容词，表示天气特征。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "What''s the weather like today?", "options": ["A. It''s sunny.", "B. I''m fine.", "C. It''s a book.", "D. I like it."]}', 'A', '问天气的句型是“What''s the weather like?”，回答要说天气情况，比如“It''s sunny.”（晴天）。其他选项是回答身体状况或物品的，不对哦。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "—Is it cold outside? —No, it ____ (is / isn''t). It''s warm.", "options": null}', 'isn''t', '问句是“外面冷吗？”，回答“No”表示不冷，所以要用否定形式“isn''t”。后面说“It''s warm.”（暖和），也说明不冷。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "What''s the weather like today? Listen to the song: ''Rain, rain, go away.'' Which weather is in the song?", "options": ["A. Sunny", "B. Rainy", "C. Snowy", "D. Windy"]}', 'B', '歌曲《Rain, rain, go away》里唱的是下雨天（rainy），所以选B。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "Complete the rhyme: ''Red sky at night, sailor''s delight. Red sky in the morning, sailor''s ______.'' (提示：根据儿歌填空，表示坏天气)", "options": null}', 'warning', '这是一首关于天气的儿歌，意思是：晚上天边红，水手乐呵呵；早上天边红，水手要当心。所以填warning（警告）。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "What is a big task in a weather project?", "options": ["A. Drawing a sun", "B. Making a weather report for a week", "C. Writing one word about rain", "D. Coloring a cloud"]}', 'B', '在天气项目中，一个大任务（big task）是指需要更多时间和努力的工作，比如制作一周的天气预报。而其他选项都是小任务（small task），很简单，很快就能完成。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '四年级', '填空', 1, '{"stem": "In a weather project, checking the temperature outside is a ______ task.", "options": null}', 'small', '检查室外温度是一个小任务（small task），因为它很容易做，不需要太多时间。大任务（big task）通常更复杂，比如写一份天气报告。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '五年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "Which word means ''a group of people who do an activity together''?", "options": ["A. club", "B. school", "C. book", "D. desk"]}', 'A', '解析：''club'' 意思是俱乐部，是一群人一起做活动。其他选项：school 是学校，book 是书，desk 是书桌，都不对。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '五年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "Fill in the blank: We go to the art ______ to paint pictures.", "options": null}', 'club', '解析：句子意思是“我们去美术俱乐部画画”。''club'' 是俱乐部，表示一个活动小组。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '五年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "你想问同学“你参加了什么俱乐部？”，应该怎么说？", "options": ["A. What club do you join?", "B. What club are you in?", "C. What club is this?", "D. What club do you like?"]}', 'B', '在英语中，询问某人参加了什么俱乐部，常用“What club are you in?”。选项A的“join”表示“加入”，但这里更习惯用“be in”来表达“参加”。选项C和D意思不对。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '五年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "根据中文提示，完成句子：我们学校有美术俱乐部。\nThere ______ an art club in our school.", "options": null}', 'is', '句子意思是“我们学校有一个美术俱乐部”，主语“an art club”是单数，所以用“is”。注意不要写成“are”。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '五年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "What club can you join if you like singing songs?", "options": ["A. Art Club", "B. Music Club", "C. Sports Club", "D. Reading Club"]}', 'B', '如果你喜欢唱歌，你可以加入音乐俱乐部（Music Club），因为音乐俱乐部是唱歌和演奏乐器的地方。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '五年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "Complete the rhyme: ''Twinkle, twinkle, little ____, how I wonder what you are.''", "options": null}', 'star', '这首儿歌叫《小星星》，歌词是''Twinkle, twinkle, little star''，所以空白处填''star''。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '五年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "在学校的俱乐部项目中，老师让大家完成一个“Big task”，比如制作一张俱乐部海报。下面哪个是“Big task”的正确意思？", "options": ["A. 小任务", "B. 大任务", "C. 游戏", "D. 作业"]}', 'B', '“Big task”意思是“大任务”，比如制作海报需要很多步骤，而“Small task”是“小任务”，比如写一个单词。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '五年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "在俱乐部活动中，老师先让大家做一个“小任务”：写出一个你喜欢的运动单词。然后做一个“大任务”：画一张俱乐部海报并写上介绍。请根据这个意思，完成句子：写单词是______ task，画海报是______ task。", "options": null}', 'small; big', '写单词是简单的“小任务”（small task），画海报是复杂的“大任务”（big task）。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '五年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "What does the word ''hopscotch'' mean?", "options": ["A. 跳房子", "B. 跳绳", "C. 踢毽子", "D. 捉迷藏"]}', 'A', 'hopscotch 是跳房子的意思，是一种传统游戏。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '五年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "The children are playing a game with a ball and a net. It''s called ______.", "options": null}', 'volleyball', '根据描述，用球和网玩的游戏是排球（volleyball），这是传统游戏的一种。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '五年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "What traditional game do you like?", "options": ["A. I like playing hide-and-seek.", "B. I like eating apples.", "C. I like reading books.", "D. I like running fast."]}', 'A', '题目问的是‘你喜欢什么传统游戏？’，只有选项A回答的是传统游戏‘捉迷藏’，其他选项不是游戏，所以选A。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '五年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "根据句意填空：Do you like ________ (play) hopscotch? Yes, I do.", "options": null}', 'playing', '这里like后面要跟动词的-ing形式，表示‘喜欢做某事’，所以play要变成playing。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '五年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "Which song is often sung when children play the game ''London Bridge is Falling Down''?", "options": ["A. Twinkle, Twinkle, Little Star", "B. London Bridge is Falling Down", "C. Happy Birthday", "D. Old MacDonald Had a Farm"]}', 'B', '当孩子们玩‘伦敦桥要塌了’这个游戏时，他们通常会唱同名的儿歌‘London Bridge is Falling Down’。其他选项是不同游戏的歌曲。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '五年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "In the rhyme ''Ring-a-Ring o'' Roses'', the last line is ''We all ______ ______.'' (Fill in the missing words)", "options": null}', 'fall down', '这首儿歌的最后一句是‘We all fall down’，意思是‘我们都倒下’，这是游戏结束时孩子们的动作。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '五年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "What is a big task in a traditional game project?", "options": ["A. Choosing the game name", "B. Making the game rules", "C. Drawing a picture of the game", "D. Writing a short sentence"]}', 'B', '在传统游戏项目中，大任务（big task）通常指更复杂、需要更多步骤的工作，比如制定游戏规则（making the game rules）。其他选项如选名字、画画或写短句是小任务（small task）。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '五年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "In a traditional game project, a small task is easy and quick. For example, ________ (write/play) the game name is a small task.", "options": null}', 'write', '小任务（small task）简单又快速，比如写游戏名字（write the game name）就是一个小任务。而‘play’是玩的意思，这里不合适。所以填‘write’。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '五年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "Which word means ''a part of a plant that grows from the stem and usually has a green color''?", "options": ["A. leaf", "B. root", "C. flower", "D. seed"]}', 'A', '叶子是植物从茎上长出的部分，通常是绿色的，所以选A。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '五年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "The _______ of a plant grows under the ground and takes in water and food.", "options": null}', 'root', '植物的根长在地下，吸收水分和营养，所以填''root''。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '五年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "What _____ you see in the garden?", "options": ["A. do", "B. does", "C. are", "D. is"]}', 'A', '这句话的意思是“你在花园里看到了什么？”主语是you，所以要用助动词do。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '五年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "The plant _____ (need) water and sunlight to grow.", "options": null}', 'needs', '主语The plant是单数，所以动词need要加s变成needs，表示“需要”。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '五年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "What is the rhyme in the song \"The Plant Song\"? (在歌曲《植物之歌》中，押韵的词是什么？)", "options": ["A. tree and bee", "B. sun and fun", "C. grow and show", "D. leaf and beef"]}', 'C', '在歌曲中，"grow" 和 "show" 发音相似，押韵，像 "grow" 和 "show" 都发 /əʊ/ 的音。其他选项不押韵，比如 "tree" 和 "bee" 虽然押韵，但不在歌曲里。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '五年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "Fill in the blank: In the song \"Amazing Plants\", we sing: \"The little seed grows in the ____, with water and sun, it''s so much fun!\" (在歌曲《神奇的植物》中，我们唱到：\"小种子在____里生长，有水和阳光，真有趣！\")", "options": null}', 'ground', '歌词中 "seed" 和 "ground" 搭配，表示种子在土壤中生长。"ground" 意思是地面或土壤，符合儿歌内容。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '五年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "在“Amazing plants”项目中，老师让大家完成一个小任务（small task），下面哪个是small task的例子？", "options": ["A. 画一种植物并写出它的名字", "B. 做一个关于植物生长的大报告", "C. 种一棵树并写一本日记", "D. 研究所有植物的种类"]}', 'A', 'small task（小任务）通常简单、用时短，比如画图或写几个单词。大任务（big task）更复杂，比如做报告或长期观察。A选项是简单的小任务，其他选项都是大任务。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '五年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "在“Amazing plants”项目中，老师把任务分成两种：一种是______ task（大任务），需要很多时间和步骤；另一种是______ task（小任务），很快就能完成。", "options": null}', 'big, small', 'big task（大任务）像种树或写报告，small task（小任务）像画图或写名字。记住：big是“大”，small是“小”。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '五年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "Which word means ''a small animal that lives in water and has fins and scales''?", "options": ["A. bird", "B. fish", "C. cat", "D. dog"]}', 'B', '鱼（fish）是一种生活在水里、有鳍和鳞片的小动物。鸟（bird）会飞，猫（cat）和狗（dog）是陆地动物，所以选B。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '五年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "A _____ is a large animal that lives on farms and gives us milk.", "options": null}', 'cow', '奶牛（cow）是农场里的大型动物，可以给我们提供牛奶。其他像猪（pig）或鸡（chicken）不产奶，所以填cow。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '五年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "What does your cat like to eat?", "options": ["It likes fish.", "It like fish.", "It liking fish.", "It is like fish."]}', 'A', '句子主语是It（第三人称单数），动词like要加s变成likes，所以选A。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '五年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "My dog _______ (run) very fast every morning.", "options": null}', 'runs', '主语My dog是第三人称单数，一般现在时动词要加s，run变成runs。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '五年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "Which animal is mentioned in the rhyme ''Old MacDonald Had a Farm''?", "options": ["A. Cow", "B. Elephant", "C. Tiger", "D. Monkey"]}', 'A', '在儿歌《Old MacDonald Had a Farm》中，常见的动物有牛、猪、鸡等，所以答案是牛（cow）。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '五年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "Complete the rhyme: ''Baa, baa, black sheep, have you any ______?''", "options": null}', 'wool', '这首儿歌《Baa, Baa, Black Sheep》中，歌词是''Baa, baa, black sheep, have you any wool?''，所以答案是wool。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '五年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "Which one is a big task?", "options": ["A. Feed the cat", "B. Build a new house for a dog", "C. Water the plants", "D. Clean the fishbowl"]}', 'B', 'Build a new house for a dog is a big task because it takes a lot of time and hard work. The others are small tasks.', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '五年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "Walk the dog every day is a ______ task, but take the dog to the vet for a check-up is a ______ task.", "options": null}', 'small, big', 'Walking the dog is easy and quick, so it''s a small task. Going to the vet needs more time and planning, so it''s a big task.', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '五年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "What should you do if you have a fever?", "options": ["A. Eat ice cream", "B. See a doctor", "C. Run outside", "D. Watch TV"]}', 'B', '如果你发烧了，应该去看医生（see a doctor），而不是吃冰淇淋、跑步或看电视。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '五年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "I have a ________ (牙痛), so I need to see a dentist.", "options": null}', 'toothache', '牙痛用英语说是 toothache，dentist是牙医，所以这里填toothache。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '五年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "你生病了，妈妈问你“What''s wrong with you?”你应该怎么回答？", "options": ["A. I have a headache.", "B. I like apples.", "C. I am ten years old.", "D. I go to school."]}', 'A', '妈妈问“你怎么了？”是在关心你的身体情况，所以回答“我头疼”最合适。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '五年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "医生问：“What''s the matter with you?” 你回答：“I ______ a fever.” (have / has)", "options": null}', 'have', '句子主语是“I”，所以用动词原形“have”，表示“我发烧了”。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '五年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "What song do you sing when you have a cold?", "options": ["A. Happy Birthday", "B. The Sick Song", "C. Twinkle Twinkle Little Star", "D. ABC Song"]}', 'B', '当你感冒时，唱《The Sick Song》最合适，因为它和生病有关。其他歌曲如《Happy Birthday》是生日歌，不相关。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '五年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "Complete the rhyme: ''Doctor, doctor, I feel ____. Please help me get better soon.''", "options": null}', 'sick', '这个儿歌讲的是看医生，所以这里应该填‘sick’（生病的），表示不舒服。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '五年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "What is a big task in the project \"Seeing a doctor\"?", "options": ["A. Draw a picture of a doctor", "B. Act out a dialogue with a doctor", "C. Write a word on the blackboard", "D. Read a sentence aloud"]}', 'B', '在“看医生”这个项目中，大任务（big task）是需要合作完成一个较复杂的活动，比如表演一段和医生的对话。小任务（small task）通常是简单的，比如画图或读单词。所以正确答案是B。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '五年级', '填空', 1, '{"stem": "In the project \"Seeing a doctor\", a small task could be to ______ the word \"fever\".", "options": null}', 'spell / write / say', '小任务（small task）通常是简单、容易完成的，比如拼写（spell）、写（write）或说（say）一个单词。这里填其中一个都可以。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '五年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "Which word means ''to try hard to do something difficult''?", "options": ["A. challenge", "B. rise", "C. easy", "D. help"]}', 'A', '单词 ''challenge'' 的意思是‘挑战’，表示努力去做一件困难的事情。其他选项：''rise'' 是‘上升’，''easy'' 是‘容易’，''help'' 是‘帮助’。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '五年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "Fill in the blank: We need to ______ to the challenge and never give up.", "options": null}', 'rise', '短语 ''rise to the challenge'' 意思是‘迎接挑战’，所以这里填 ''rise''。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '五年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "Which sentence is correct? 哪个句子是正确的？", "options": ["A. She can swims fast.", "B. She can swim fast.", "C. She can swimming fast.", "D. She can swam fast."]}', 'B', '在can后面，动词要用原形，所以swim不能加s或ing。正确句子是She can swim fast.', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '五年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "根据提示完成句子：We ______ (能) finish the work before 5 o''clock.（提示：用can或can''t）", "options": null}', 'can', '句子的意思是“我们能在5点前完成工作”，表示能力或可能性，所以填can。注意can后面动词用原形finish。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '五年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "What is the main idea of the song ''Rise to the Challenge''?", "options": ["A. It''s about playing games.", "B. It''s about facing difficulties bravely.", "C. It''s about eating healthy food.", "D. It''s about going to school."]}', 'B', '这首歌的标题是''Rise to the Challenge''，意思是''迎接挑战''，所以主要讲的是勇敢面对困难。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '五年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "Complete the rhyme: ''When you face a problem, don''t give up the ____.''", "options": null}', 'fight', '这句儿歌的意思是''当你遇到问题时，不要放弃战斗''，所以填''fight''最合适。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '五年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "Which one is a big task?", "options": ["A. Brush your teeth", "B. Clean the whole house", "C. Tie your shoes", "D. Open a book"]}', 'B', '打扫整个房子需要很多时间和努力，所以它是一个大任务。其他选项都是简单的小任务。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '五年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "A _______ task is easy and quick to do, like washing your hands. A _______ task takes more time and effort, like organizing a class party.", "options": null}', 'small; big', '小任务（small task）做起来简单快速，比如洗手。大任务（big task）需要更多时间和努力，比如组织班级派对。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '五年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "Which word means ''a person who studies science and does experiments''?", "options": ["A. scientist", "B. teacher", "C. doctor", "D. farmer"]}', 'A', 'scientist 意思是''科学家''，就是做科学实验的人。其他选项：teacher 老师，doctor 医生，farmer 农民，都不符合。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '五年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "Complete the sentence: Thomas Edison was a great _______. He invented the light bulb.", "options": null}', 'scientist', '句子说托马斯·爱迪生发明了电灯泡，他是一位伟大的科学家。所以填 scientist。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '五年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "Which sentence is correct?", "options": ["A. He is a great scientist.", "B. He are a great scientist.", "C. He am a great scientist.", "D. He be a great scientist."]}', 'A', '主语是he，是第三人称单数，所以要用is，不能用are、am或be。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '五年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "用正确的单词填空：This scientist ______ (invent) many useful things.", "options": null}', 'invented', '这句话讲的是过去的事情，所以用过去式invented。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '五年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "Which song is about a famous scientist who discovered gravity?", "options": ["A. Twinkle, Twinkle, Little Star", "B. The Wheels on the Bus", "C. Old MacDonald Had a Farm", "D. Row, Row, Row Your Boat"]}', 'A', '《Twinkle, Twinkle, Little Star》这首歌是关于科学家牛顿的故事，他发现了万有引力。其他歌曲都与科学家无关。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '五年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "Complete the rhyme: ''Mary had a little lamb, its fleece was white as ____.''", "options": null}', 'snow', '这首经典儿歌中，最后一句是‘its fleece was white as snow’，意思是它的羊毛像雪一样白。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '五年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "What is a ''big task'' in a science project?", "options": ["A. A small job like drawing a picture", "B. A main goal like building a model rocket", "C. A quick test to see if something works", "D. A fun game to play with friends"]}', 'B', '在科学项目中，''big task'' 指的是主要任务，比如建造一个模型火箭，它需要很多步骤才能完成。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '五年级', '填空', 1, '{"stem": "In a science project, a _______ (big/small) task is something easy and quick to do, like writing down a date.", "options": null}', 'small', '''small task'' 指的是小任务，比如写一个日期，它很简单、很快就能完成。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '五年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "Which word means ''a machine that helps you talk to people far away''?", "options": ["A. car", "B. telephone", "C. book", "D. pencil"]}', 'B', '电话（telephone）是一种能让你和远方的人说话的工具，所以选B。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '五年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "A _______ helps us see small things, like tiny bugs or cells. (Hint: starts with ''m'')", "options": null}', 'microscope', '显微镜（microscope）是一种发明，能让我们看到很小的东西，比如小虫子或细胞。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '五年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "What can a washing machine do?", "options": ["A. It can wash clothes.", "B. It can cook food.", "C. It can fly in the sky.", "D. It can read books."]}', 'A', '洗衣机是用来洗衣服的，所以正确答案是A。其他选项都不对，因为洗衣机不能做饭、飞或读书。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '五年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "—What can a _______ do? —It can help us see in the dark.", "options": null}', 'flashlight', '手电筒（flashlight）可以在黑暗中帮助我们看到东西，所以空白处应填flashlight。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '五年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "Which song can help us remember the days in each month?", "options": ["A. \"Twinkle, Twinkle, Little Star\"", "B. \"Thirty Days Has September\"", "C. \"Row, Row, Row Your Boat\"", "D. \"Happy Birthday\""]}', 'B', '《Thirty Days Has September》是一首帮助记忆每个月天数的儿歌，而其他选项与月份无关。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '五年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "在歌曲《The Wheels on the Bus》中，车轮转呀转，请写出歌词中车轮发出的声音：______", "options": null}', 'round and round', '歌曲中唱到“The wheels on the bus go round and round”，所以答案是“round and round”。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '五年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "Which of the following is a big task?", "options": ["A. Cleaning your room", "B. Building a house", "C. Washing dishes", "D. Writing a letter"]}', 'B', 'Building a house is a big task because it takes a lot of time and people. Cleaning your room, washing dishes, and writing a letter are small tasks.', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '五年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "Finishing homework is a ______ task, but organizing a school fair is a ______ task.", "options": null}', 'small, big', 'Homework is usually small because one person can do it quickly. A school fair is big because many people and lots of planning are needed.', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '五年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "Which word means \"to put information into a computer\"?", "options": ["A. type", "B. click", "C. print", "D. delete"]}', 'A', '''Type'' 意思是打字输入，比如在键盘上打字，把信息放进电脑里。''Click'' 是点击鼠标，''print'' 是打印，''delete'' 是删除，所以选 A。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '五年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "I use the ________ to move the cursor on the screen. (提示：一个电脑部件，可以点击)", "options": null}', 'mouse', '鼠标 (mouse) 可以用来移动屏幕上的光标，点击选择东西。这是一个常用的电脑部件。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '五年级', '单选', 2, '{"stem": "你正在用电脑写作业，想告诉朋友“我可以用电脑做作业”，应该怎么说？", "options": ["A. I can use the computer to do my homework.", "B. I can use the computer to play games.", "C. I can use the computer to watch TV.", "D. I can use the computer to eat lunch."]}', 'A', '这句话表达的是用电脑来做作业，只有A选项正确描述了做作业这个动作。其他选项分别是玩游戏、看电视和吃午饭，不符合题意。', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
  '英语', '五年级', '填空', 3, '{"stem": "妈妈问你在电脑上做什么，你回答：“I can ______ the computer to ______ emails.”（提示：用/使用/发送）", "options": null}', 'use; send', '这个句子中，第一个空需要填‘use’，表示‘使用’电脑；第二个空填‘send’，表示‘发送’邮件。完整的句子是‘I can use the computer to send emails.’，意思是‘我可以用电脑发送邮件。’', 'llm', '[]', NULL, 0);
